    "updated_at": "2019-04-26T19:20:33Z",
    "body": "In addition, _please stop throwing your trash in my home!_ I live in there and it's getting too dang messy. :angry: \r\n\r\n*Ahem*\r\n\r\nThere are too many applications that dump configs in the user's home directory which can lead to complete horror when they need to show hidden files in their home. (A well-used system can accumulate hundreds of hidden files and folders in the poor user's home, it's chaos!)\r\n\r\nIt would be a good idea to refrain from contributing to the mess and should respect `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`. If it doesn't exist, default to `~/.config/starship.something`?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
