    "updated_at": "2019-04-24T13:33:09Z",
    "body": "I'd love to get started with adding configuration to Starship soon. The more sections we add now, the bigger the backlog will be. 😅\r\n\r\n@starship/astronauts Let's have a quick vote to see how people are feeling.\r\nIf you've been quietly following the conversation, feel free to vote as well.\r\n\r\n### Configuration Preference\r\n[![](https://api.gh-polls.com/poll/01D97REM2XK5FTVXDEY1KGMQFK/YAML)](https://api.gh-polls.com/poll/01D97REM2XK5FTVXDEY1KGMQFK/YAML/vote)\r\n[![](https://api.gh-polls.com/poll/01D97REM2XK5FTVXDEY1KGMQFK/TOML)](https://api.gh-polls.com/poll/01D97REM2XK5FTVXDEY1KGMQFK/TOML/vote)\r\n[![](https://api.gh-polls.com/poll/01D97REM2XK5FTVXDEY1KGMQFK/Both%20(YAML%20and%20TOML))](https://api.gh-polls.com/poll/01D97REM2XK5FTVXDEY1KGMQFK/Both%20(YAML%20and%20TOML)/vote)\r\n",
